de exists in `App.css` \u2014 browser default focus\n-  styling is used app-wide. Not introducing one here either.\n-- No in-flight/spinner state exists on any button in this app (`Add`,\n-  `Complete`, `Delete`, `Save` all fire-and-await via `run()` with no busy\n-  indicator). Not introducing one here either, for consistency.\n-\n-## New component\n-\n...\n</persisted-output>", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01WD6fkEooXF6imPmHfJ9dxN", "session_id": "6dcc71cd-8fe6-43d5-9dea-cd22fc6362f0"}}
