ion 3) \u2014 explicitly called out\n83-  by the requester.\n84-- All tasks open / all tasks done (one bucket at 0, still must read as\n85:  plural \"0 tasks\", not suppressed or hidden).\n86:- Loading state before first fetch resolves (criterion 8).\n87-- Rapid successive mutations \u2014 already handled by the existing `run()` \u2192\n88-  `refresh()` cycle in `App.jsx:40-49`, which re-fetches and re-renders\n89-  after every mutation; the count just needs to derive from `tasks` on every", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01F9vKn2eHXNNRQmN2kL7NC1", "session_id": "6dcc71cd-8fe6-43d5-9dea-cd22fc6362f0"}}
