{"ts": "2026-08-17T12:15:18Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 64, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "const OPTIONS = [\n  { value: 'all', label: 'All' },\n  { value: 'open', label: 'Open' },\n  { value: 'done', label: 'Done' },\n]\n\nexport default function TaskFilter({ value, onChange }) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"task-filter\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter tasks\">\n      {OPTIONS.map((opt) => (\n        <button\n          key={opt.value}\n          type=\"button\"\n          className={opt.value === value ? 'filter-option active' : 'filter-option'}\n          aria-pressed={opt.value === value}\n          onClick={() => onChange(opt.value)}\n        >\n          {opt.label}\n        </button>\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n---\n\n> frontend@0.0.0 build\n> vite build\n\nvite v8.2.1 building client environment for production...\n\u001b[2K\rtransforming...\u2713 22 modules transformed.\nrendering chunks...\ncomputing gzip size...\ndist/index.html                   0.45 kB \u2502 gzip:  0.29 kB\ndist/assets/index-BRB6usvm.css    2.14 kB \u2502 gzip:  0.78 kB\ndist/assets/index-D9Os2OJ9.js   195.63 kB \u2502 gzip: 61.63 kB\n\n\u2713 built in 107ms", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_012581PcvtAEMxUywxtajcU3", "session_id": "6dcc71cd-8fe6-43d5-9dea-cd22fc6362f0"}}
